OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CThursday:FA mostly dry, cloudy         
OL,6,Fmorning, with northeastern showers     
OL,7,Feasing. Heavy rain and strong winds    
OL,8,Facross Northern Ireland and western    
OL,9,FScotland later. Mostly cold, slightly  
OL,10,Fmilder in the far west.                
